    "body": "Merged main to resolve the conflicts with #469, #471 and #475:\n- **UI conflicts:** module lists and tree-menu arms, both sides kept.\n- **Semantic fix:** this branch's shared fixture law (`fixture_struck::op_hits`) read the **active** machine's spindle and table. It now reads the op's own setup's machine, keeping #471's per-setup rule.\n- **Re-gated:** app `fixture_ux`, `fixtures`, `fixture_mesh`, `setup_mounts_post`, `setup_mount`, `program_entry`, `posting` and `mcp`, plus the ui fixture, program_entry and `--test fixtures` suites, all pass; clippy is clean.",
